{"id":281463201,"title":"2.Day2","summary":"1.表单受控绑定2.React中获取DOM","content":"<p><strong>1.表单受控绑定</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786882612032-b2e178cb-3517-4ed4-bab3-376960b3b095.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786882813598-01e9f639-cd53-41dc-a6f5-390e0831d6a4.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787214315496-e65cc3c8-146c-400d-b584-233f6a5bccde.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>2.React中获取DOM</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786883130447-79ce4ab1-0021-4c24-99f1-a09a15350ea4.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786883346465-bcc09b46-d97d-4364-a9e4-b78a093261f4.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786883388888-23c01978-4dc8-481e-96b9-1851b6a3f97b.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<hr>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>3.发表评论--核心功能实现</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786883475468-7c7aa9db-a369-469d-b03f-c49bb6c7f044.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>4.发表评论-id和时间处理</strong></p>\n<p><strong>5.发表评论--清空内容和聚焦实现</strong></p>\n<p><strong>6.组件通信--父传子--基础实现</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786883571243-bba0740d-c876-4196-abb5-f8a48f92aafa.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786883599964-9a812ce2-9516-402f-bd0d-2809baf7a4d0.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>一开始的空框架<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786883639306-78c61c39-0531-4318-80a0-98fc6e6e2488.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referr