n.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786884569763-37a97cba-65af-444b-9a35-87b6071aa078.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>10.使用状态提升实现兄弟组件通信</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786887759337-a91969f5-01b8-418a-9c72-0d2798f7ae2e.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786887779643-ec142f32-18b4-4399-ad9f-07e7b70c8c4a.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786887873785-7ea28a67-db3c-4f39-88f7-780453b4f2dd.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786887884604-b4483949-487b-48a3-8e18-fb0b28952038.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786887907481-78c5f901-4be2-435a-b04f-29336922735d.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>11.使用context机制跨层传递数据</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786887964654-05e6cbf9-96bc-47e6-af92-93fe36a1f3c1.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787283387270-35a22ced-95a8-424f-8043-5c160873c8f2.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787283424309-a5210d74-caca-43ec-bcb7-dff404c1bc22.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787283448395-2d732eb8-886b-46ca-9142-88b16ee3ca88.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786888072090-4fd55f54-2084-4b67-9461-86e9a34f43ef.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786888098718-9ddb69aa-dc7c-4f48-b0ed-4ac3f9bbc9c9.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786888134741-c4d90795-6000-4f4a-8a30-6247660d4a5e.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786888109765-097ab519-7a24-4a82-b1d9-a0209040444d.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>12.useEffect--概念理解和基础使用</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786888213831-1ca5846f-a181-4b3f-8c46-3a309f5b6fac.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>【】：依赖项数组<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787284040639-70f01fcd-2236-4c7e-b2da-f9edfeaa8468.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786888297801-54a35fa8-6c83-43e4-961b-17c9d2c0b881.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786888575186-21e10d67-9137-4430-ac83-6e96eac72c29.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786888583882-b937a6bc-b6fc-4fc3-8d52-8d4a2811c673.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>13.useEffect--不同依赖项说明</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786888687074-6021cfc9-f815-40fa-aeb6-ad7894c05abb.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p> 情况 1：依赖数组为空 <code>[]</code>--<strong>组件第一次渲染完成之后，执行 1 次，之后再也不跑</strong></p>\n<p> 情况 2：数组里面写变量 <code>[count]</code>--<strong>组件第一次渲染会跑；之后，只要数组里面的 count 发生变化，就重新跑一遍里面的代码</strong>。  </p>\n<p> 情况 3：完全不写第二个参数（不写数组)--<strong>组件每更新一次，渲染完页面，这个函数就跑一次，非常频繁，少用</strong>。  </p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786889146400-69d85b11-d38e-4428-8afd-d20864d614a3.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786889152679-a955dbde-144b-4984-9806-4aa5d209f06e.png\" alt=\"\">一开始会先执行一次。后面每一次点击都会触发一次</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786889223369-754de9f1-4123-4c0c-a208-f6a4199154cf.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786889210360-6a3109ee-cc87-42ca-9e6b-8fe56ac3c5e0.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786889252242-771da58b-c93a-4ee4-a2ab-7ea0eee2acdf.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786889261959-1b1a188e-df05-4556-b56d-3b7ccd00cfe9.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>14.useEffect--清除副作用</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786889350024-6769b731-d64d-4796-9a81-967820a70dd6.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786889460273-edeea7e2-cabc-4646-bb8c-45f003c11361.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>15.自定义Hook实现</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786889567831-cc42ef5f-33ad-4058-8bb7-3db79f0141b7.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786889769572-c2fad601-2e4a-41bf-9a26-fa33369fcbde.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786889852113-ec51b98d-cc44-4d07-9125-923223e5a935.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>点击toggle就可以隐藏上面的内容<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786889891697-d2823ba9-335b-4d41-bdb1-135a33f5f8df.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786889954126-8e2a2a0d-3df8-4d20-aaf6-6a5cc1b6bcf4.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>16.ReactHooks使用规则说明</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786889996452-ef0337fc-b0d7-4d38-a5d4-5a8c4c792ef7.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786890116151-2f5f754a-8185-4b1f-8459-21a2b0f75a3a.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787292502505-b146d45f-6e10-4fb1-8ce4-90d3114feaa8.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n","contentFormat":"markdown","source":"yuque","cover":"","category_id":82407692,"category":{"id":82407692,"name":"React","description":""},"created_at":"2026-08-15T05:55:57.000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-21T06:08:25.000Z","view_count":0,"like_count":0,"is_top":0,"is_featured":0,"tags":[],"status":"published","yuqueUrl":"https://www.yuque.com/woyaoyizhishuidajue/rlg5dd/wem8tez9a1psye8h","slug":"wem8tez9a1psye8h","wordCount":355}